        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 161.55,
          "end": 164.49,
          "en": "and also follow these instructions for Windows here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 164.49,
          "end": 168.03,
          "en": "to set up AutoGPT on your system.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 168.03,
          "end": 171.24,
          "en": "It's also worth noting that, under the Hood, AutoGPT,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 171.24,
          "end": 175.2,
          "en": "of course, is using those GPT models, as I mentioned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 175.2,
          "end": 179.94,
          "en": "And therefore you need an API key from OpenAI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 179.94,
          "end": 184.38,
          "en": "so that you can use these models in your own programs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 184.38,
          "end": 188.55,
          "en": "Now, of course, AutoGPT isn't a program you created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 188.55,
          "end": 191.97,
          "en": "but it is a program you installed on your system.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 191.97,
          "end": 195.63,
