        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 195.63,
          "end": 198.36,
          "en": "you, in the end, just download all that code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 198.36,
          "end": 202.59,
          "en": "and run that on your system so it's like a program you wrote",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 202.59,
          "end": 205.41,
